.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd September 30, 2026
.Dt UMOUNT 8
.Os OxideBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm umount
.Nd unmount file systems
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl fv
.Ar special | node ...
.Nm
.Fl a
.Op Fl fv
.Op Fl t Ar type Ns Op , Ns Ar type ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
detaches the file system mounted on each
.Ar node ,
or named by
.Ar special ,
so that the directory shows its own contents again.
.Pp
The options are:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl a
Unmount every file system in
.Xr fstab 5
that is mounted, except the root, last listed first.
.It Fl f
Unmount even while files on it are in use.
.It Fl t Ar type
With
.Fl a ,
only these types, or with a leading
.Dq no ,
not these.
.It Fl v
Name each file system unmounted.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr fstab 5 ,
.Xr mount 8
.Sh HISTORY
A
.Nm
command appeared in
.At v1 .
